# Scenario-level override that pins AtomikosTransactionManagerProvider
# as a ServiceLoader candidate. AtomikosTransactionManagerProvider's
# @Priority(Integer.MAX_VALUE - 101) is lower (= higher priority) than
# the default AutoSelectTransactionManagerProvider at
# @Priority(Integer.MAX_VALUE), so the project's ServicePriorityResolver
# picks Atomikos as the head — independent of which JTA-impl profile
# the parent build activated. Without this override, AutoSelect would
# probe the classpath and prefer Geronimo (when present in the active
# profile), which would defeat the scenario's intent of exercising
# Atomikos specifically.
org.os890.jawelte.module.jta.impl.adapter.provider.AtomikosTransactionManagerProvider
